# We publish straight from this directory now instead of copying an allowlisted
# subset into D:\github. cptogithub.bat was an explicit allowlist, so this is
# ignore-everything plus anchored re-allows. This directory also holds thousands
# of research artefacts (sweep renders, close_matches/, bulb_out/, *.png/.bmp),
# scratch scripts and .orchestrator_history -- none of which were ever published.

*

!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/imgui.ini
!/julia4d.html
!/julia4d.py
!/main.cpp
!/requirements.txt
!/search.py
